# Copy to users.conf and set a real password. users.conf is gitignored.
#
# Format: username:password[:e][:uid[:gid[:homedir]]][:directory-list]
#   - Append ':e' after the password if it is already hashed (e.g. bcrypt).
#   - uid 1001 avoids conflicts with host system users.
#   - Listed directories are created automatically inside the user's home.
#
# → CPI Security Material (User Credentials): LAB_SFTP_CREDS  (user labuser)
#   Host key trust:  Known Hosts (SSH)  LAB_SFTP_KNOWNHOSTS  (scripts/known-hosts.sh)
#   CPI SFTP paths:  /inbox  /outbox  /upload  /archive
#
# Example (replace CHANGEME):
labuser:CHANGEME:1001::upload,inbox,outbox,archive
